(2470534, 340188, 37252, '<td valign="top">I like this shot - I love the use of the lighting permitted and the b/w choice. Nice details throughout. Focus is strongest in just the right places. My only dislike here is the object that shadows in the right lower corner. I think I would have preferred to see a continuation of the pottery piece there. Not sure what is in the upper right corner either, but I would have cloned it out as it would not have been a major element.</td>', 'I like this shot - I love the use of the lighting permitted and the b/w choice. Nice details throughout. Focus is strongest in just the right places. My only dislike here is the object that shadows in the right lower corner. I think I would have preferred to see a continuation of the pottery piece there. Not sure what is in the upper right corner either, but I would have cloned it out as it would not have been a major element.', '2006-05-31 03:46:10.000000', NULL, 1),
