(2470560, 339859, 37252, '<td valign="top">The lighting seems very harsh here. Reds can be difficult to manage and I think the front flower really gave you some problems here. The image lacks a central focus point...I see parts of the peach rose in focus, and most of the pink rose in focus, but very poor focus on the red rose.</td>', 'The lighting seems very harsh here. Reds can be difficult to manage and I think the front flower really gave you some problems here. The image lacks a central focus point...I see parts of the peach rose in focus, and most of the pink rose in focus, but very poor focus on the red rose.', '2006-05-31 04:00:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2470568, 340635, 37252, '<td valign="top">Interesting abstract. I like the sense of motion that is incorporated into this image as it makes it more interesting</td>', 'Interesting abstract. I like the sense of motion that is incorporated into this image as it makes it more interesting', '2006-05-31 04:03:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2470582, 340147, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very nice shot. The focus is tack sharp and the details of the feathers are well demonstrated. The very bottom edge of the feathers has a odd gray edge. The black background has a couple areas that needed to be cloned due to hot spots or white specks. Overall a very nice entry - just wish more time had been taken to clean up the background as this was advanced editing and simple cloning would have corrected it.</td>', 'Very nice shot. The focus is tack sharp and the details of the feathers are well demonstrated. The very bottom edge of the feathers has a odd gray edge. The black background has a couple areas that needed to be cloned due to hot spots or white specks. Overall a very nice entry - just wish more time had been taken to clean up the background as this was advanced editing and simple cloning would have corrected it.', '2006-05-31 04:08:25.000000', NULL, 1),
