(2471963, 340535, 57886, '<td valign="top">Good picture. Like the pw.</td>', 'Good picture. Like the pw.', '2006-05-31 12:52:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471973, 340748, 58469, '<td valign="top">There are 2 things I would have done differently with this photo - First, I don''t think that the centered composition works very well, it may have been a better photograph if it were not centered. Secondly, the disappearing hand, in particular, seems awkward to me. Overall though, well done!</td>', 'There are 2 things I would have done differently with this photo - First, I don''t think that the centered composition works very well, it may have been a better photograph if it were not centered. Secondly, the disappearing hand, in particular, seems awkward to me. Overall though, well done!', '2006-05-31 12:55:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2471997, 340660, 45022, '<td valign="top"><b></b>Yeah, Those 600mm Lenses Come In Handy for Pissed off Spiders :)</td>', 'Yeah, Those 600mm Lenses Come In Handy for Pissed off Spiders :)', '2006-05-31 13:04:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472026, 340646, 37252, '<td valign="top">rather than use shallow DOF on this, I think sharp focus throughout would make it stronger. The black of the image itself looks dusty - you truly had me thinking it was my monitor. A quick dusting of the monitor revealed that is was indeed on your photo. Under advanced editing, there are so many things you can do to correct this.</td>', 'rather than use shallow DOF on this, I think sharp focus throughout would make it stronger. The black of the image itself looks dusty - you truly had me thinking it was my monitor. A quick dusting of the monitor revealed that is was indeed on your photo. Under advanced editing, there are so many things you can do to correct this.', '2006-05-31 13:11:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472032, 340653, 37252, '<td valign="top">Sharp focus on the eyelashes....just wish the eyeball itself was as sharp.</td>', 'Sharp focus on the eyelashes....just wish the eyeball itself was as sharp.', '2006-05-31 13:12:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472037, 338701, 57886, '<td valign="top">Wow, great idea... excellent picture and lightning and clarity... well done 9 from me :o)</td>', 'Wow, great idea... excellent picture and lightning and clarity... well done 9 from me :o)', '2006-05-31 13:13:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472039, 340748, 37252, '<td valign="top">The lighting is good and exposure well executed. The pose the model is in looks too exagerated - the back seems overly arched to where it doesnt look comfortable. The left arm is back a bit too far in my opinion.</td>', 'The lighting is good and exposure well executed. The pose the model is in looks too exagerated - the back seems overly arched to where it doesnt look comfortable. The left arm is back a bit too far in my opinion.', '2006-05-31 13:14:04.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472046, 340790, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful blue tones - work well here in this dusk setting. The light is well shot - not over exposed. I like the composition - nice straight horizon with the light off to one side. Focus appears tack sharp without having to over use USM. Good job</td>', 'Beautiful blue tones - work well here in this dusk setting. The light is well shot - not over exposed. I like the composition - nice straight horizon with the light off to one side. Focus appears tack sharp without having to over use USM. Good job', '2006-05-31 13:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472050, 340673, 37252, '<td valign="top">IMage appears OOF and grainy. Not particularly a strong composition.</td>', 'IMage appears OOF and grainy. Not particularly a strong composition.', '2006-05-31 13:16:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472056, 340179, 47608, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2006-05-31 13:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472058, 340781, 37252, '<td valign="top">The colors appear drab - maybe you could have improved this by adjusting your exposure values and curves adjustment. The subject itself just doesnt have any special appeal. The background would be better if jet black without any reflections - jmho</td>', 'The colors appear drab - maybe you could have improved this by adjusting your exposure values and curves adjustment. The subject itself just doesnt have any special appeal. The background would be better if jet black without any reflections - jmho', '2006-05-31 13:18:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2472063, 340660, 57886, '<td valign="top">J.C. come on... are you still a life!!! The colors are nice, lightning also, it could have been slightly more in focus, but 7... from me.. :o) good work (also on surviving this MONSTER)</td>', 'J.C. come on... are you still a life!!! The colors are nice, lightning also, it could have been slightly more in focus, but 7... from me.. :o) good work (also on surviving this MONSTER)', '2006-05-31 13:19:07.000000', NULL, 1),
