(2472101, 338485, 37252, '<td valign="top">Lighting is good and strong composition. Well focused. Not sure what that fuzzy looking area is to the upper left hand corner but I would clone it out and have it as black as the background - it''s a bit distracting</td>', 'Lighting is good and strong composition. Well focused. Not sure what that fuzzy looking area is to the upper left hand corner but I would clone it out and have it as black as the background - it''s a bit distracting', '2006-05-31 13:29:59.000000', NULL, 1),
