(2472845, 338485, 15711, '<td valign="top">Exquisitely done. Perfect positioning.  The tulle behind her really adds some movement and a varying texture.  10</td>', 'Exquisitely done. Perfect positioning.  The tulle behind her really adds some movement and a varying texture.  10', '2006-05-31 17:07:27.000000', NULL, 1),
