(2473987, 340791, 37252, '<td valign="top">I realize the laptop isnt giving off the ideal lighting here, but the colors look too muddy. Maybe some tweaking with curves and or contrast could give this image a boost. The focus seems a bit soft - need to sharpen it up some.</td>', 'I realize the laptop isnt giving off the ideal lighting here, but the colors look too muddy. Maybe some tweaking with curves and or contrast could give this image a boost. The focus seems a bit soft - need to sharpen it up some.', '2006-05-31 21:58:20.000000', NULL, 1),
