(2474455, 339598, 52790, '<td valign="top">cute shot, although i kind of wish it was darker outside. even a sunset would have been nice, not complete darkness. I like how it isn''t just the child''s shadow, but also the shadow of a parent (assumedly mother). Well done. 8</td>', 'cute shot, although i kind of wish it was darker outside. even a sunset would have been nice, not complete darkness. I like how it isn''t just the child''s shadow, but also the shadow of a parent (assumedly mother). Well done. 8', '2006-05-31 23:51:37.000000', NULL, 1),
