(2475049, 338490, 37252, '<td valign="top">The angle the light is hitting the subject just does not work well for me. I would like to see a bit more of the face not so shadowed, as well as the mouth and front paws not cropped off.</td>', 'The angle the light is hitting the subject just does not work well for me. I would like to see a bit more of the face not so shadowed, as well as the mouth and front paws not cropped off.', '2006-06-01 03:46:53.000000', NULL, 1),
