(2475060, 340027, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice focus and composition. Great catch lights in the eyes. The eyes say a lot and are crisp and clear. I dont really think the dark scarf/hood on the head goes well with the fan - they just dont compliment each other.</td>', 'Nice focus and composition. Great catch lights in the eyes. The eyes say a lot and are crisp and clear. I dont really think the dark scarf/hood on the head goes well with the fan - they just dont compliment each other.', '2006-06-01 03:56:35.000000', NULL, 1),
