(2477860, 340239, 37252, '<td valign="top">well done with the lighting and the expression. Together they really set a mood</td>', 'well done with the lighting and the expression. Together they really set a mood', '2006-06-02 00:43:38.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477867, 340215, 37252, '<td valign="top">The source of lighting appears to be sunlight - which is not using one source of artificial light as the challenge directed. Aside from that, the image is over-exposed for the amount of lighting coming through the window. The feet being cropped off and the odd stance of the cat make the composition weak.</td>', 'The source of lighting appears to be sunlight - which is not using one source of artificial light as the challenge directed. Aside from that, the image is over-exposed for the amount of lighting coming through the window. The feet being cropped off and the odd stance of the cat make the composition weak.', '2006-06-02 00:45:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477874, 339433, 59932, '<td valign="top">Perfect lighting and composition.  <br/> <br/>There is an awful yellow color cast, though.</td>', 'Perfect lighting and composition.   There is an awful yellow color cast, though.', '2006-06-02 00:46:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477877, 339044, 37252, '<td valign="top">Love the composition and the backlighting! Excellent job.</td>', 'Love the composition and the backlighting! Excellent job.', '2006-06-02 00:47:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477885, 338938, 37252, '<td valign="top">Way over exposed - you cannot even tell there was a mud puddle in existence here.</td>', 'Way over exposed - you cannot even tell there was a mud puddle in existence here.', '2006-06-02 00:48:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477893, 340154, 59932, '<td valign="top">Interesting concept.  Up that contrast!  <br/>Also, it would be cool if the girl had something different about her on each side.  Different aspects of her personality - like a good vs. evil type theme.  <br/>Just a thought :)</td>', 'Interesting concept.  Up that contrast!  Also, it would be cool if the girl had something different about her on each side.  Different aspects of her personality - like a good vs. evil type theme.  Just a thought :)', '2006-06-02 00:49:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477898, 338781, 37252, '<td valign="top">Very good capture of lightning, however the challenge details said to use a single source of ARTIFICIAL light. Lightning is a natural source</td>', 'Very good capture of lightning, however the challenge details said to use a single source of ARTIFICIAL light. Lightning is a natural source', '2006-06-02 00:50:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477900, 340787, 59932, '<td valign="top">Perfect example of what you can do with only one light!  Amazing color saturation, and use of negative space.  Bravo.</td>', 'Perfect example of what you can do with only one light!  Amazing color saturation, and use of negative space.  Bravo.', '2006-06-02 00:50:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477904, 340327, 59932, '<td valign="top">Great lighting.  It really accentuates the textures of these worn objects.  I also like the color contrast happening with the blue on the clamp.  <br/> <br/>The only thing bothering me about this is the composition - the void in the foreground is making me uneasy.</td>', 'Great lighting.  It really accentuates the textures of these worn objects.  I also like the color contrast happening with the blue on the clamp.   The only thing bothering me about this is the composition - the void in the foreground is making me uneasy.', '2006-06-02 00:52:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477910, 340532, 59932, '<td valign="top">Nice lighting - just not enough of it.  Having a stark white along the outline of the figure would really ring ''ambition'' with me.</td>', 'Nice lighting - just not enough of it.  Having a stark white along the outline of the figure would really ring ''ambition'' with me.', '2006-06-02 00:53:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477917, 339232, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nicely composed, and good use of the lighting.</td>', 'Nicely composed, and good use of the lighting.', '2006-06-02 00:55:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477919, 340158, 37252, '<td valign="top">Focus is too soft on the piano keys. I would have liked to see them in better focus and have the light off to one side instead of glaring right in the middle</td>', 'Focus is too soft on the piano keys. I would have liked to see them in better focus and have the light off to one side instead of glaring right in the middle', '2006-06-02 00:56:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477922, 340745, 37252, '<td valign="top">The centering of the model works well here as the outstretched arms balances the  image. I like the raw emotion that is pouring out from his expression. Good use of lighting and well exposed.</td>', 'The centering of the model works well here as the outstretched arms balances the  image. I like the raw emotion that is pouring out from his expression. Good use of lighting and well exposed.', '2006-06-02 00:58:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477925, 340288, 37252, '<td valign="top">Great capture, but where is the use of a single ARTIFICIAL light source?</td>', 'Great capture, but where is the use of a single ARTIFICIAL light source?', '2006-06-02 01:00:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477927, 338848, 49578, '<td valign="top">What i like - the low key style, the composition<br/>What bothers me - the face gives a bit of a troubled look due to probably the forehead lines. A more complacent and peaceful look helps the photo IMO</td>', 'What i like - the low key style, the compositionWhat bothers me - the face gives a bit of a troubled look due to probably the forehead lines. A more complacent and peaceful look helps the photo IMO', '2006-06-02 01:00:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(2477931, 340125, 37252, '<td valign="top">The composition is lacking any point of interest and is overall just not appealing to me. The image is very grainy and poorly exposed</td>', 'The composition is lacking any point of interest and is overall just not appealing to me. The image is very grainy and poorly exposed', '2006-06-02 01:01:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478017, 340786, 55642, '<td valign="top">I may be missing something, but I''m counting at least two light sources here, since I don''t see how whatever is backlighting the model can also be reflecting off the mirror pasted on the model''s chest (since I''m assuming that''s how the spot was created)?</td>', 'I may be missing something, but I''m counting at least two light sources here, since I don''t see how whatever is backlighting the model can also be reflecting off the mirror pasted on the model''s chest (since I''m assuming that''s how the spot was created)?', '2006-06-02 01:33:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478021, 339400, 55642, '<td valign="top">Looks oddly like a Klimt painting...</td>', 'Looks oddly like a Klimt painting...', '2006-06-02 01:34:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478055, 339859, 55642, '<td valign="top">The reds are oversaturated.</td>', 'The reds are oversaturated.', '2006-06-02 01:42:41.000000', NULL, 1);
INSERT INTO comments ("id", "image_id", "commenter_id", "raw_comment", "comment", "date", "edited", "made_during_challenge") VALUES
(2478109, 339694, 10339, '<td valign="top">Great use of the light on one half of the face. I like how you have clearly captured the blue eye. Nicely done.</td>', 'Great use of the light on one half of the face. I like how you have clearly captured the blue eye. Nicely done.', '2006-06-02 01:56:13.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478133, 339674, 42957, '<td valign="top">I like the colors here and expression of the model.  I like titles, too, so the <b><i>~</i></b> rather bothers me--but the picture itself is nice.</td>', 'I like the colors here and expression of the model.  I like titles, too, so the ~ rather bothers me--but the picture itself is nice.', '2006-06-02 02:02:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478149, 340480, 42957, '<td valign="top">The strand of hair is rather distracting.<br/>Lovely skin tones and nice lighting; the face could be a little sharper.<br/>I like the top.<br/>Good job!</td>', 'The strand of hair is rather distracting.Lovely skin tones and nice lighting; the face could be a little sharper.I like the top.Good job!', '2006-06-02 02:08:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478152, 338488, 42957, '<td valign="top">Lovely eyes!  Excellent eye capture!</td>', 'Lovely eyes!  Excellent eye capture!', '2006-06-02 02:09:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478164, 340784, 42957, '<td valign="top">I love this.  Love it--lovely shadows!  I like how there''s a little light in the background, keeping the black sweater from disappearing into the darkness--wonderful depth.  And the mask--I love how one eye we can see and the other is a black hole. Nice work, nice work; this better ribbon! 10.</td>', 'I love this.  Love it--lovely shadows!  I like how there''s a little light in the background, keeping the black sweater from disappearing into the darkness--wonderful depth.  And the mask--I love how one eye we can see and the other is a black hole. Nice work, nice work; this better ribbon! 10.', '2006-06-02 02:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(2478174, 339566, 42957, '<td valign="top">I like bonsai trees.  The lighting/sharpening is a bit harsh, like the right side of the tree trunk, but I really like the fog--although, the purply-orangeness on the right is a bit distracting.</td>', 'I like bonsai trees.  The lighting/sharpening is a bit harsh, like the right side of the tree trunk, but I really like the fog--although, the purply-orangeness on the right is a bit distracting.', '2006-06-02 02:15:50.000000', NULL, 1),
