(2478642, 338785, 42984, '<td valign="top">This is a fine study but I''m afraid I can''t score well as I am sure there is more than one light source.  The spines of the books are beautifully balanced with the main subject, but they had to have a light source to be seen.  Since your main light source is on the other side of them, it couldn''t have come from there.</td>', 'This is a fine study but I''m afraid I can''t score well as I am sure there is more than one light source.  The spines of the books are beautifully balanced with the main subject, but they had to have a light source to be seen.  Since your main light source is on the other side of them, it couldn''t have come from there.', '2006-06-02 10:10:55.000000', NULL, 1),
