(2479111, 340186, 9690, '<td valign="top">This is just toooooo awesome.  There isn''t anything to critique, really.  I love the lighting, of course.  And I like how the top part of the stem is illuminated.  I hope a ribbon is coming your way!  10</td>', 'This is just toooooo awesome.  There isn''t anything to critique, really.  I love the lighting, of course.  And I like how the top part of the stem is illuminated.  I hope a ribbon is coming your way!  10', '2006-06-02 14:10:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479113, 339598, 9690, '<td valign="top">You may be raked over the coals for this, but you have two light sources here.  One in the tent, and one is the sun.  Kinda tough to call as far as meeting challenge guidelines.  But the picture itself is cute.</td>', 'You may be raked over the coals for this, but you have two light sources here.  One in the tent, and one is the sun.  Kinda tough to call as far as meeting challenge guidelines.  But the picture itself is cute.', '2006-06-02 14:12:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479114, 339784, 9690, '<td valign="top">Weird.</td>', 'Weird.', '2006-06-02 14:12:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479115, 339782, 9690, '<td valign="top">How odd, yet very creative.  It took me a second to catch what was going on.  Good job!</td>', 'How odd, yet very creative.  It took me a second to catch what was going on.  Good job!', '2006-06-02 14:13:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479116, 340302, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat idea.  Great capture.  The dog adds to the depth.  I like this one!  9</td>', 'Neat idea.  Great capture.  The dog adds to the depth.  I like this one!  9', '2006-06-02 14:14:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479118, 340488, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat take on something that has been done before.  I think this is a unique approach.  I like the composition and cropping. 9</td>', 'Neat take on something that has been done before.  I think this is a unique approach.  I like the composition and cropping. 9', '2006-06-02 14:14:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479119, 339044, 55005, '<td valign="top">So elegant! My absolute favorite from this challenge!</td>', 'So elegant! My absolute favorite from this challenge!', '2006-06-02 14:16:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479122, 340629, 55005, '<td valign="top">Excellent texture and colors!  I might have cropped it tighter (too much black on the left side) and maybe a square crop would have worked better here but this is a beautful photo regardless...</td>', 'Excellent texture and colors!  I might have cropped it tighter (too much black on the left side) and maybe a square crop would have worked better here but this is a beautful photo regardless...', '2006-06-02 14:17:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479125, 340615, 55005, '<td valign="top">I really like the colors but the focus is a bit too soft for my taste.  Sharp middle part of the flower (the yellow part) and soft petals would, in my opinion, work better.</td>', 'I really like the colors but the focus is a bit too soft for my taste.  Sharp middle part of the flower (the yellow part) and soft petals would, in my opinion, work better.', '2006-06-02 14:19:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479130, 339604, 9690, '<td valign="top">I think this would have been better if you didn''t see the actual lighting fixture in the background at all.</td>', 'I think this would have been better if you didn''t see the actual lighting fixture in the background at all.', '2006-06-02 14:21:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479132, 340179, 55005, '<td valign="top">I love this type of photos and colors are great!  I just wish that the edges of the paper were a bit sharper, especially in the top right corner -- I think the impact would have been much stringer that way.</td>', 'I love this type of photos and colors are great!  I just wish that the edges of the paper were a bit sharper, especially in the top right corner -- I think the impact would have been much stringer that way.', '2006-06-02 14:21:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479134, 338716, 9690, '<td valign="top">You may have used only one light source, but it is so evenly distributed that it loses the drama of only having one light.</td>', 'You may have used only one light source, but it is so evenly distributed that it loses the drama of only having one light.', '2006-06-02 14:22:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479136, 340369, 9690, '<td valign="top">Gorgeous.  Very good.  I love it!  10</td>', 'Gorgeous.  Very good.  I love it!  10', '2006-06-02 14:22:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479138, 338781, 9690, '<td valign="top">Wow.  To bad the foreground tree and house don''t add a whole lot to the picture, but this lighting capture is simply amazing.</td>', 'Wow.  To bad the foreground tree and house don''t add a whole lot to the picture, but this lighting capture is simply amazing.', '2006-06-02 14:23:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479139, 340558, 9690, '<td valign="top">This is nice, but it seems to be a bit over exposed in a couple of areas.</td>', 'This is nice, but it seems to be a bit over exposed in a couple of areas.', '2006-06-02 14:23:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479141, 340662, 55005, '<td valign="top">Ah, waht a texture! Love the colors as well.. I feel, though, that making it a bit lighter and bringing out details where all the veins intersect might work better.  Currently, on my screen, it looks like a black hole.  Just my 2 cents.</td>', 'Ah, waht a texture! Love the colors as well.. I feel, though, that making it a bit lighter and bringing out details where all the veins intersect might work better.  Currently, on my screen, it looks like a black hole.  Just my 2 cents.', '2006-06-02 14:23:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479142, 338686, 9690, '<td valign="top">So very cool.  I assume the light source was the sun?</td>', 'So very cool.  I assume the light source was the sun?', '2006-06-02 14:23:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479143, 338490, 9690, '<td valign="top">I like it, but I think the shadow fall off is a bit too dramatic.</td>', 'I like it, but I think the shadow fall off is a bit too dramatic.', '2006-06-02 14:24:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479145, 339400, 9690, '<td valign="top">This is just way to busy for my tastes.  You may want to simplify for future challenges and watch your focus depth.</td>', 'This is just way to busy for my tastes.  You may want to simplify for future challenges and watch your focus depth.', '2006-06-02 14:25:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479146, 340329, 55005, '<td valign="top">Well done!</td>', 'Well done!', '2006-06-02 14:26:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479147, 339147, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat.  With a bit more light on the front (outside of the current challenge) this would be a good advertisement shot.</td>', 'Neat.  With a bit more light on the front (outside of the current challenge) this would be a good advertisement shot.', '2006-06-02 14:26:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479150, 339674, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very good.  Nice colors, great sharpness with a bit of grain.  Good job! 10</td>', 'Very good.  Nice colors, great sharpness with a bit of grain.  Good job! 10', '2006-06-02 14:27:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479152, 340653, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very neat.  I love it! 10</td>', 'Very neat.  I love it! 10', '2006-06-02 14:27:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479153, 340478, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very cool.  Great way to take a unique view on an ordinary object 10</td>', 'Very cool.  Great way to take a unique view on an ordinary object 10', '2006-06-02 14:28:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479154, 339782, 55005, '<td valign="top">Well done!  Brought a huge smile to my face!</td>', 'Well done!  Brought a huge smile to my face!', '2006-06-02 14:28:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479155, 340390, 9690, '<td valign="top">Well, I''d guess the flash along with the sun would count as two light sources, but I''m not a stickler for stuff like that.  But what I think you may have missed is the dramatic effects that can be created with a single light source.</td>', 'Well, I''d guess the flash along with the sun would count as two light sources, but I''m not a stickler for stuff like that.  But what I think you may have missed is the dramatic effects that can be created with a single light source.', '2006-06-02 14:29:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479156, 340280, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very neat, but it seems to be tilted to the right a bit ~8</td>', 'Very neat, but it seems to be tilted to the right a bit ~8', '2006-06-02 14:29:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2479157, 339912, 9690, '<td valign="top">Hmmmm... I''m guessing you were going for the rainbow to appear to come out of the shell... but it just doesn''t do it for me.</td>', 'Hmmmm... I''m guessing you were going for the rainbow to appear to come out of the shell... but it just doesn''t do it for me.', '2006-06-02 14:30:33.000000', NULL, 1),
