(2480030, 338781, 33982, '<td valign="top">ar·ti·fi·cial (är''t&amp;#601;-f&amp;#301;sh''&amp;#601;l) pronunciation<br/>adj.<br/>   1.<br/>         1. Made by humans; produced rather than natural.<br/>         2. Brought about or caused by sociopolitical or other human-generated forces or influences: set up artificial barriers against women and minorities; an artificial economic boom.<br/>   2. Made in imitation of something natural; simulated: artificial teeth.<br/>   3. Not genuine or natural: an artificial smile.</td>', 'ar·ti·fi·cial (är''t&#601;-f&#301;sh''&#601;l) pronunciationadj.   1.         1. Made by humans; produced rather than natural.         2. Brought about or caused by sociopolitical or other human-generated forces or influences: set up artificial barriers against women and minorities; an artificial economic boom.   2. Made in imitation of something natural; simulated: artificial teeth.   3. Not genuine or natural: an artificial smile.', '2006-06-02 20:00:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(2480050, 340453, 29011, '<td valign="top">Nothing else to say really...Beatiful!  One minor nitpick, since her left ear is out of view might have darkened the right one too.</td>', 'Nothing else to say really...Beatiful!  One minor nitpick, since her left ear is out of view might have darkened the right one too.', '2006-06-02 20:11:14.000000', NULL, 1),
