(2480916, 340610, 6999, '<td valign="top">I keep hoping for something to emerge from those shadows, like a stick-figure leaning on the crutch, but it isn''t happening. It''s a competent shot, well lit and nicely enough detailed, but I can''t see it as an engaging image.</td>', 'I keep hoping for something to emerge from those shadows, like a stick-figure leaning on the crutch, but it isn''t happening. It''s a competent shot, well lit and nicely enough detailed, but I can''t see it as an engaging image.', '2006-06-03 08:40:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2480918, 339381, 6999, '<td valign="top">Solid work - that deep blue is usually popular here. Unsure about the composition, as there seems a great deal of dead space to image left, and i can''t quite see a use for it.</td>', 'Solid work - that deep blue is usually popular here. Unsure about the composition, as there seems a great deal of dead space to image left, and i can''t quite see a use for it.', '2006-06-03 08:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2480922, 339782, 6999, '<td valign="top">Clever, especially the blurring of the chicken-shadow. The positioning of the egg itself is a little uncomfortable, perhaps because it doesn''t sit well with the edge of the spotlight.</td>', 'Clever, especially the blurring of the chicken-shadow. The positioning of the egg itself is a little uncomfortable, perhaps because it doesn''t sit well with the edge of the spotlight.', '2006-06-03 08:46:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2480923, 340235, 6999, '<td valign="top">Such regular right-angled lines really become quite unsettling, in a way that doesn''t feel deliberate, if they''re not framed absolutely squarely; either go for more diagonal, or properly square, but fractionally off is only ever going to look like a mistake, I''m afraid.</td>', 'Such regular right-angled lines really become quite unsettling, in a way that doesn''t feel deliberate, if they''re not framed absolutely squarely; either go for more diagonal, or properly square, but fractionally off is only ever going to look like a mistake, I''m afraid.', '2006-06-03 08:48:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(2480925, 340497, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nice tonality, but not the kind of thing that does it for me, really.</td>', 'Nice tonality, but not the kind of thing that does it for me, really.', '2006-06-03 08:51:39.000000', NULL, 1),
