(2481007, 338781, 18367, '<td valign="top">A very nice image, but it seems to be missing the artificial light source called for in the challenge.  I also believe you might have considered cropping out the sunset at the left as it draws one attention away from that fabulous lightning flash you captured.</td>', 'A very nice image, but it seems to be missing the artificial light source called for in the challenge.  I also believe you might have considered cropping out the sunset at the left as it draws one attention away from that fabulous lightning flash you captured.', '2006-06-03 10:11:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481024, 339886, 18367, '<td valign="top">This is a striking image, but it would seem the image was taken outside at high noon, and as such missing a prime component of the challenge, namely an artificial source of light.</td>', 'This is a striking image, but it would seem the image was taken outside at high noon, and as such missing a prime component of the challenge, namely an artificial source of light.', '2006-06-03 10:26:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481045, 338736, 18367, '<td valign="top">Sunshine is an artificial light source???</td>', 'Sunshine is an artificial light source???', '2006-06-03 10:35:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481058, 340535, 18367, '<td valign="top">A very interesting image, although from my perspective the cropping will cost you. You might have considered cropping the image immediately to the right of the man''s left shoulder.</td>', 'A very interesting image, although from my perspective the cropping will cost you. You might have considered cropping the image immediately to the right of the man''s left shoulder.', '2006-06-03 10:40:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481107, 339886, 39057, '<td valign="top">Although not "artificial" I''m going to score it as if it was artificial light. I see other shots in this challenge using "flames" or "fire" as artificial light...but guess what...the sun is "flame" and "fire" !</td>', 'Although not "artificial" I''m going to score it as if it was artificial light. I see other shots in this challenge using "flames" or "fire" as artificial light...but guess what...the sun is "flame" and "fire" !', '2006-06-03 11:23:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481185, 340369, 6999, '<td valign="top">Has the beginnings of a decent image, I think. It looks as though youv''e simply pushed the contrast quite far, when to get decently detailed black and white from digital requires more subtle work; it also has extremely shallow depth of field, leaving me unsure exactly which part of your image you consider to be the main point. The bright tips of one flower have become over-exposed, and either that depth if field or your processing hasn''t left much to see in the other areas.</td>', 'Has the beginnings of a decent image, I think. It looks as though youv''e simply pushed the contrast quite far, when to get decently detailed black and white from digital requires more subtle work; it also has extremely shallow depth of field, leaving me unsure exactly which part of your image you consider to be the main point. The bright tips of one flower have become over-exposed, and either that depth if field or your processing hasn''t left much to see in the other areas.', '2006-06-03 12:40:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481189, 338383, 6999, '<td valign="top">Various highlights and shading in the face of that cliff don''t seem to bear any relation to moonlight, not the apparent shape of the stone, which is disconcerting to say the least; it makes it look as though it were variously lit with about ten different lights, whereas I''m fairly sure it''s just processing. Nevertheless, its quite an intriguing image, and presumably successful to your aims.</td>', 'Various highlights and shading in the face of that cliff don''t seem to bear any relation to moonlight, not the apparent shape of the stone, which is disconcerting to say the least; it makes it look as though it were variously lit with about ten different lights, whereas I''m fairly sure it''s just processing. Nevertheless, its quite an intriguing image, and presumably successful to your aims.', '2006-06-03 12:43:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481190, 340772, 46097, '<td valign="top">The more I look, the more I see in this, and the more I like it, in it''s Norman Rockwell type of appeal. The apple is just the most lovely prop. Please include your postprocessing notes...i''m very interested to find out.</td>', 'The more I look, the more I see in this, and the more I like it, in it''s Norman Rockwell type of appeal. The apple is just the most lovely prop. Please include your postprocessing notes...i''m very interested to find out.', '2006-06-03 12:44:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481192, 340329, 6999, '<td valign="top">Nicely done - shows the fragility of the bloom.</td>', 'Nicely done - shows the fragility of the bloom.', '2006-06-03 12:44:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481206, 340484, 18157, '<td valign="top">Very nice picture. I think it would be just as if not more effective with no markings on the face.</td>', 'Very nice picture. I think it would be just as if not more effective with no markings on the face.', '2006-06-03 12:50:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481207, 340110, 6132, '<td valign="top">Wonderful detail that you have captured. A really interesting photograph.</td>', 'Wonderful detail that you have captured. A really interesting photograph.', '2006-06-03 12:51:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481242, 340610, 37252, '<td valign="top">Lighting: good use of  I like the shadow of the crutch and the angle it is cast against the wall.<br/>Composition: Nice angle - triangulates the frame well<br/>Exposure: seems right on<br/>Subject: lacks interest...it''s a crutch. Does not really tell me a story, and the crop is not one that would work well for a stock shot.</td>', 'Lighting: good use of  I like the shadow of the crutch and the angle it is cast against the wall.Composition: Nice angle - triangulates the frame wellExposure: seems right onSubject: lacks interest...it''s a crutch. Does not really tell me a story, and the crop is not one that would work well for a stock shot.', '2006-06-03 13:25:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481244, 340190, 37252, '<td valign="top">Good use of light to bring out the natural lines and curves of the human form. Maybe a tiny bit more of an angle with the light would have brought out more curves along the back side.</td>', 'Good use of light to bring out the natural lines and curves of the human form. Maybe a tiny bit more of an angle with the light would have brought out more curves along the back side.', '2006-06-03 13:27:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2481245, 340689, 37252, '<td valign="top">Nice for a high-contrast image. Good use of lighting to set a mood.</td>', 'Nice for a high-contrast image. Good use of lighting to set a mood.', '2006-06-03 13:28:00.000000', NULL, 1),
