(2481457, 339228, 37252, '<td valign="top">Beautiful still life image - great work with the lighting too. Focus is tack sharp. Good luck in the challenge.</td>', 'Beautiful still life image - great work with the lighting too. Focus is tack sharp. Good luck in the challenge.', '2006-06-03 14:56:29.000000', NULL, 1),
