(2482416, 340563, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the idea and the lighting generally looks good. However, I might try difusing the light some more so it''s less harsh on the label at the bottom.</td>', 'I like the idea and the lighting generally looks good. However, I might try difusing the light some more so it''s less harsh on the label at the bottom.', '2006-06-03 22:51:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482417, 339289, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the main subject and the color however I think this would have worked out better without the lamp in the shot.</td>', 'I like the main subject and the color however I think this would have worked out better without the lamp in the shot.', '2006-06-03 22:53:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482423, 340459, 41337, '<td valign="top">I like the choice in subject however, it''s just too soft for me. Might I suggest either going with a smaller aperture to get more sharp or if the lens allows go with an extremely narrow DOF for artistic effect. What you used here is too "middle of the road" and thus doesn''t carry the wow factor that either of my suggestions could provide. Also, there is a lot of color here but it''s a bit dull. If you are limited with your post processing than try boosting up your saturation settings in camera.</td>', 'I like the choice in subject however, it''s just too soft for me. Might I suggest either going with a smaller aperture to get more sharp or if the lens allows go with an extremely narrow DOF for artistic effect. What you used here is too "middle of the road" and thus doesn''t carry the wow factor that either of my suggestions could provide. Also, there is a lot of color here but it''s a bit dull. If you are limited with your post processing than try boosting up your saturation settings in camera.', '2006-06-03 22:57:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482426, 339903, 41337, '<td valign="top">Cool idea. One thing you may want to try is to show something on the other side via a shadow to raise the tension in this shot. Might not quite work in a still frame shot like this but I''m thinking like in a movie when a shadow suddenly appears.</td>', 'Cool idea. One thing you may want to try is to show something on the other side via a shadow to raise the tension in this shot. Might not quite work in a still frame shot like this but I''m thinking like in a movie when a shadow suddenly appears.', '2006-06-03 23:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482429, 340393, 41337, '<td valign="top">Nice product shot. I can''t believe you used only one light source for this.</td>', 'Nice product shot. I can''t believe you used only one light source for this.', '2006-06-03 23:02:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482435, 340277, 41337, '<td valign="top">Changing the angle of the light source just a bit could have helped this greatly. There needs to be more light shining on the front to show more detail.</td>', 'Changing the angle of the light source just a bit could have helped this greatly. There needs to be more light shining on the front to show more detail.', '2006-06-03 23:04:35.000000', NULL, 1),
