(2482659, 340722, 36006, '<td valign="top">I don''t know why I like this, maybe because of it''s simplicity.<br/> <br/>I like the offset of the comp, the lighting works for me, the top of the bricks are a bit blown, and the window is dipping into the abyss, great texture, excellent movement, color a bit flat but it works, minimalistic, nice lines</td>', 'I don''t know why I like this, maybe because of it''s simplicity. I like the offset of the comp, the lighting works for me, the top of the bricks are a bit blown, and the window is dipping into the abyss, great texture, excellent movement, color a bit flat but it works, minimalistic, nice lines', '2006-06-04 01:00:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(2482662, 340392, 36006, '<td valign="top">I hope you don''t get comments like..."its been done".<br/> <br/>Excellent comp, great idea even for something that has been done before, I love the lighting, I love the color against the b&amp;w, the blacks are dipping into the abyss and the whites are blown but because of the color contrast it works, nice movement, nice lines, good job</td>', 'I hope you don''t get comments like..."its been done". Excellent comp, great idea even for something that has been done before, I love the lighting, I love the color against the b&w, the blacks are dipping into the abyss and the whites are blown but because of the color contrast it works, nice movement, nice lines, good job', '2006-06-04 01:03:42.000000', NULL, 1),
