(2484132, 340748, 19311, '<td valign="top">This shot is simply fantastic. Its real soft yet high contrast at the same time.  The heavy shadow gives it a sense of mystery and the curves are accentuated extemely well by the light.  I wish it could fill the frame a little more but thats my only complaint.   9</td>', 'This shot is simply fantastic. Its real soft yet high contrast at the same time.  The heavy shadow gives it a sense of mystery and the curves are accentuated extemely well by the light.  I wish it could fill the frame a little more but thats my only complaint.   9', '2006-06-04 19:50:02.000000', NULL, 1),
