(2484148, 340278, 19311, '<td valign="top">I like the reflections from the ball radiating outwards.  I think it would be nicer with a solid black background and you need to be carefull with those highlights.  You''ve blown them out completeley on a good chunk of the ball.  In the future, expose for the highlights so you have detail there and then bring the shadows back in post processing.  You can''t bring highlights back because there is no detail to begin with.</td>', 'I like the reflections from the ball radiating outwards.  I think it would be nicer with a solid black background and you need to be carefull with those highlights.  You''ve blown them out completeley on a good chunk of the ball.  In the future, expose for the highlights so you have detail there and then bring the shadows back in post processing.  You can''t bring highlights back because there is no detail to begin with.', '2006-06-04 19:56:45.000000', NULL, 1),
