(2484188, 340309, 19311, '<td valign="top">Love the location and lighting here.  Your model is gorgeous and the idea of wings is real cool.  Her expression seems a little stern and her arms and hands are very static.  Particularly her right arm looks like its lifeless.  Would like to see some of these with them in a stronger pose but thats my only complaint.  The muted colors of the location really bring attention to the models soft skin.  Good stuff, shots like this are what make wish I had my own studio lights. 9</td>', 'Love the location and lighting here.  Your model is gorgeous and the idea of wings is real cool.  Her expression seems a little stern and her arms and hands are very static.  Particularly her right arm looks like its lifeless.  Would like to see some of these with them in a stronger pose but thats my only complaint.  The muted colors of the location really bring attention to the models soft skin.  Good stuff, shots like this are what make wish I had my own studio lights. 9', '2006-06-04 20:19:23.000000', NULL, 1),
