(2486257, 340392, 9690, '<td valign="top">Very neat.  I love the look of this image.  By taking a light source and creating an unexpected contrast, you were able to take this challenge to another level.  Good job 10</td>', 'Very neat.  I love the look of this image.  By taking a light source and creating an unexpected contrast, you were able to take this challenge to another level.  Good job 10', '2006-06-05 11:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486258, 340288, 9690, '<td valign="top">This is a beautiful pic.  What a great capture!  8</td>', 'This is a beautiful pic.  What a great capture!  8', '2006-06-05 11:12:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486259, 339657, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat... very creepy!</td>', 'Neat... very creepy!', '2006-06-05 11:13:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486262, 340263, 9690, '<td valign="top">This reminds me of the opening to the original, 1960s Batman movie!<br/> <br/>Great job!</td>', 'This reminds me of the opening to the original, 1960s Batman movie! Great job!', '2006-06-05 11:14:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486265, 340777, 9690, '<td valign="top">Great shot!  I think by having the model pose that way, you get a different sense of the human form.  The lighting and the curve work together nicely.</td>', 'Great shot!  I think by having the model pose that way, you get a different sense of the human form.  The lighting and the curve work together nicely.', '2006-06-05 11:15:02.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486277, 340772, 9690, '<td valign="top">Boy, I''m not sure if the others are giving you hell for post-processing or not, but I really love this picture.  I love the grain and the overall simplicity.  I think it gives it a very nostalgic feel for when we can all think back to our days in school.  <br/> <br/>Great job!  I hope the photo-purists don''t beat you up too much!  We need more "artists" around here.</td>', 'Boy, I''m not sure if the others are giving you hell for post-processing or not, but I really love this picture.  I love the grain and the overall simplicity.  I think it gives it a very nostalgic feel for when we can all think back to our days in school.   Great job!  I hope the photo-purists don''t beat you up too much!  We need more "artists" around here.', '2006-06-05 11:19:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486278, 338938, 9690, '<td valign="top">Were you shooting for a brown ribbon???? :))</td>', 'Were you shooting for a brown ribbon???? :))', '2006-06-05 11:20:08.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486280, 340659, 9690, '<td valign="top">Neat idea!  I like it.</td>', 'Neat idea!  I like it.', '2006-06-05 11:20:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486283, 339030, 9690, '<td valign="top">Tooooooo cool.  Great way to use lighting!</td>', 'Tooooooo cool.  Great way to use lighting!', '2006-06-05 11:21:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486286, 340575, 9690, '<td valign="top">Great setup and overall look to the picture.  But it comes off a bit dull.  I think you may have found something more interesting to take a picture of.  A person on a couch talking on a phone is not very emotive.</td>', 'Great setup and overall look to the picture.  But it comes off a bit dull.  I think you may have found something more interesting to take a picture of.  A person on a couch talking on a phone is not very emotive.', '2006-06-05 11:22:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486359, 340558, 57628, '<td valign="top">Neat Idea.</td>', 'Neat Idea.', '2006-06-05 11:58:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(2486362, 340545, 57628, '<td valign="top">I like the angle that this was taken from a lot, but I think it would''ve done much better if it were more in focus. --6</td>', 'I like the angle that this was taken from a lot, but I think it would''ve done much better if it were more in focus. --6', '2006-06-05 11:59:29.000000', NULL, 1),
