(2489228, 338485, 10752, '<td valign="top">Excellent photo! Shows all the fineness of the pregnancy and the single source light creates a very scenographic atmosphere! Thanks for the experience you gave to us...</td>', 'Excellent photo! Shows all the fineness of the pregnancy and the single source light creates a very scenographic atmosphere! Thanks for the experience you gave to us...', '2006-06-06 07:02:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(2489232, 339784, 10752, '<td valign="top">Brilliant idea! Nice atmosphere. Is like a piece of light art in a gallery! A 9!</td>', 'Brilliant idea! Nice atmosphere. Is like a piece of light art in a gallery! A 9!', '2006-06-06 07:03:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(2489267, 339674, 6999, '<td valign="top">A fine, detailed portrait; everything is as it should be here. The clasped hands, I think, bring s sense of determination to a pose that might have spoken of contemplation or exhaustion without that.</td>', 'A fine, detailed portrait; everything is as it should be here. The clasped hands, I think, bring s sense of determination to a pose that might have spoken of contemplation or exhaustion without that.', '2006-06-06 07:12:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(2489278, 340154, 6999, '<td valign="top">Given the advanced rule-set''s lack of restrictions, I think some work to increase the general contrast of this shot might have helped you: the transparency of those faces is made by the lines appearing through them, not the washed-out quality, and anyway the image is just too generally grey for big impact.</td>', 'Given the advanced rule-set''s lack of restrictions, I think some work to increase the general contrast of this shot might have helped you: the transparency of those faces is made by the lines appearing through them, not the washed-out quality, and anyway the image is just too generally grey for big impact.', '2006-06-06 07:15:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(2489292, 340393, 6999, '<td valign="top">There''s a certain technical achievement to this kind of product shot, which you''ve achieved pretty well. It would be more seductive, perhaps, if you paid a little more attention to the reflection of your light-source - the most effective of such shots use a big soft-light not only for the diffuse nature of the light, but also for the glossy quality that is lent to the product by the large area of the direct reflection - removing some of the ''cheap''-looking effect of a single spot of light appearing, as here, on those beads for instance.</td>', 'There''s a certain technical achievement to this kind of product shot, which you''ve achieved pretty well. It would be more seductive, perhaps, if you paid a little more attention to the reflection of your light-source - the most effective of such shots use a big soft-light not only for the diffuse nature of the light, but also for the glossy quality that is lent to the product by the large area of the direct reflection - removing some of the ''cheap''-looking effect of a single spot of light appearing, as here, on those beads for instance.', '2006-06-06 07:18:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(2489305, 340025, 6999, '<td valign="top">Things have gone so badly wrong here that this is either an attempt to finish last, the result of absolute lack of knowledge about digital imaging, or some kind of joke.</td>', 'Things have gone so badly wrong here that this is either an attempt to finish last, the result of absolute lack of knowledge about digital imaging, or some kind of joke.', '2006-06-06 07:20:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(2489316, 340662, 6999, '<td valign="top">Good tonality, good display of the near-abstract natural world. Colour combination is interesting, but it''s not absolutely grabbing me I''m afraid.</td>', 'Good tonality, good display of the near-abstract natural world. Colour combination is interesting, but it''s not absolutely grabbing me I''m afraid.', '2006-06-06 07:21:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(2489333, 338938, 6999, '<td valign="top">I guess the best approach is not to vote at all.</td>', 'I guess the best approach is not to vote at all.', '2006-06-06 07:31:39.000000', NULL, 1),
