(2489628, 340240, 27339, '<td valign="top">I think you should pull back on the composition a little bit and maybe get the entire object in frame. The bottom isn''t so bad, but the top of the peacock on the edge of the frame creates a lot of visual tension for me.</td>', 'I think you should pull back on the composition a little bit and maybe get the entire object in frame. The bottom isn''t so bad, but the top of the peacock on the edge of the frame creates a lot of visual tension for me.', '2006-06-06 09:47:56.000000', NULL, 1),
