(2492915, 340621, 37858, '<td valign="top">Trading Post Comment<br/> <br/>I thought the photo was a bit harshly lighted with the right thigh blown out (at least on my monitor).  The DOF also seems to shallow because the shadow is fuzzy, which might not happen with more depth to the picture.  <br/> <br/>The composition was good.  I would have liked to see a stronger, cleaner shadow, because in a sense this photo is as much about the shadow as the Woody IMHO.<br/> <br/>I gave this a 5.  The idea was fine, the lighting and DOF didn''t work for me though.</td>', 'Trading Post Comment I thought the photo was a bit harshly lighted with the right thigh blown out (at least on my monitor).  The DOF also seems to shallow because the shadow is fuzzy, which might not happen with more depth to the picture.   The composition was good.  I would have liked to see a stronger, cleaner shadow, because in a sense this photo is as much about the shadow as the Woody IMHO. I gave this a 5.  The idea was fine, the lighting and DOF didn''t work for me though.', '2006-06-07 02:36:58.000000', NULL, 0),
(2492949, 340708, 59343, '<td valign="top">wow, I''m impressed with this photo.  It can be hard to get good photos of jellyfish--they are usually poorly lit.  The detail in this one is absolutely phenomenal. Great job.  I''m impressed with the relative lack of noise given the high iso...very nice.</td>', 'wow, I''m impressed with this photo.  It can be hard to get good photos of jellyfish--they are usually poorly lit.  The detail in this one is absolutely phenomenal. Great job.  I''m impressed with the relative lack of noise given the high iso...very nice.', '2006-06-07 02:43:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2493039, 340186, 48717, '<td valign="top">LOL on your write up - good job on the pic!  So this is technically two...scratch that...three (forgot about Sherwins) flowers on the main page! Proves flowers dont have to be boring!  Guess you won the head to head competition with all of The Netherlands also!</td>', 'LOL on your write up - good job on the pic!  So this is technically two...scratch that...three (forgot about Sherwins) flowers on the main page! Proves flowers dont have to be boring!  Guess you won the head to head competition with all of The Netherlands also!', '2006-06-07 03:07:14.000000', NULL, 0),
