(2493211, 340527, 17148, '<td valign="top">:: Critique Club ::<br/> <br/>Great light...so bright...pure white. Also love the deep red to fill the image. But what is it that is being dropped in the glass? It almost made too big of a splash to even notice the splash...if that makes sense. If it had been a smaller object and the splash would then in turn be smaller and would be stronger, in my opinion. Like a small grape right in the middle making a perfect splash and having the rest of the glass pretty much undisturbed would have made for a stronger image...again in my opinion. I hope I have made the slightest bit of sense...if not ask and I''ll try and explain again...then again you might just want to disregard everything you''ve just read anyways. Technically it''s a well shot photo...great job on that merit.   <br/></td>', ':: Critique Club :: Great light...so bright...pure white. Also love the deep red to fill the image. But what is it that is being dropped in the glass? It almost made too big of a splash to even notice the splash...if that makes sense. If it had been a smaller object and the splash would then in turn be smaller and would be stronger, in my opinion. Like a small grape right in the middle making a perfect splash and having the rest of the glass pretty much undisturbed would have made for a stronger image...again in my opinion. I hope I have made the slightest bit of sense...if not ask and I''ll try and explain again...then again you might just want to disregard everything you''ve just read anyways. Technically it''s a well shot photo...great job on that merit.   ', '2006-06-07 04:02:39.000000', NULL, 0),
