(2493672, 338944, 53572, '<td valign="top">a very nice image.  abstarct, but not unrecognisably so.  the main probelems are the flecks of whit on the left side - very distratcting - and the noise.  this is one image that doesn''t benefit from noise.  perhaps either a wider or shallower depth of field - so the cd is either crisp or completely out of focus.  right now it looks just - not in focus, unintentionally.  the star filter might be a bit distracting too - i''m not sure...<br/> <br/>good creative thinking a nd setup.  well done.</td>', 'a very nice image.  abstarct, but not unrecognisably so.  the main probelems are the flecks of whit on the left side - very distratcting - and the noise.  this is one image that doesn''t benefit from noise.  perhaps either a wider or shallower depth of field - so the cd is either crisp or completely out of focus.  right now it looks just - not in focus, unintentionally.  the star filter might be a bit distracting too - i''m not sure... good creative thinking a nd setup.  well done.', '2006-06-07 08:36:21.000000', NULL, 0),
