(2493759, 339030, 24454, '<td valign="top">Woo Hoo Sherwin!!!!   Mega congratulations on your first blue ribbon! (The first of many I''m sure) This is SO AMAZING!!!   I feel like when I stumbled on your amazing photos the other day, I discovered a wonderful talent that I couldn''t wait see more work from. .. .and here you are in first place in this really competitive challenge!! <br/> <br/>You TOTALLY ROCK!!!!!!!</td>', 'Woo Hoo Sherwin!!!!   Mega congratulations on your first blue ribbon! (The first of many I''m sure) This is SO AMAZING!!!   I feel like when I stumbled on your amazing photos the other day, I discovered a wonderful talent that I couldn''t wait see more work from. .. .and here you are in first place in this really competitive challenge!!  You TOTALLY ROCK!!!!!!!', '2006-06-07 08:55:00.000000', NULL, 0),
