(2493799, 339598, 30049, '<td valign="top">Thanks!  You hit it right on the head, as far as what I was attempting to do.<br/><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by ShutterPug:</b></div><hr/><i> Very nice job - love the sihouoettes of Mom and child in the tent by the glow of the inside light. I like the composition too - not too tight cropped, lets me see the area they are camping in without losing the subject matter </i></td></tr></table></td>', 'Thanks!  You hit it right on the head, as far as what I was attempting to do.Originally posted by ShutterPug: Very nice job - love the sihouoettes of Mom and child in the tent by the glow of the inside light. I like the composition too - not too tight cropped, lets me see the area they are camping in without losing the subject matter ', '2006-06-07 09:04:16.000000', NULL, 0),
(2493840, 340186, 34192, '<td valign="top">Who would have thunk it.  Of all your beautiful shots, the dandelion takes the ribbon.  Great image - you have elevated the mere dandelion to art.  Congrats and well deserved. :)</td>', 'Who would have thunk it.  Of all your beautiful shots, the dandelion takes the ribbon.  Great image - you have elevated the mere dandelion to art.  Congrats and well deserved. :)', '2006-06-07 09:15:02.000000', NULL, 0),
(2493861, 338485, 52713, '<td valign="top">My top pick. Awesome shot. congrats!</td>', 'My top pick. Awesome shot. congrats!', '2006-06-07 09:22:10.000000', NULL, 0),
(2493921, 340786, 42845, '<td valign="top">That''s so neat.</td>', 'That''s so neat.', '2006-06-07 09:33:29.000000', NULL, 0),
(2493961, 340378, 54731, '<td valign="top">Just in case you don''t go back to the thread: I gave you a 7 and I liked the image and especially the shadow but there is a hot spot on the face and that might have made voters give a low score. The problem sometimes is not the monitor being good or bad but the calibration. I saw my own entry really bright and many people said it was too dark. I suggest you check how it looks in at least one more monitor before submitting.</td>', 'Just in case you don''t go back to the thread: I gave you a 7 and I liked the image and especially the shadow but there is a hot spot on the face and that might have made voters give a low score. The problem sometimes is not the monitor being good or bad but the calibration. I saw my own entry really bright and many people said it was too dark. I suggest you check how it looks in at least one more monitor before submitting.', '2006-06-07 09:44:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2493987, 338686, 36006, '<td valign="top">It''s too bad you did not follow the rules. A great pix gone to waste in a silly challenge over a virtual ribbon.</td>', 'It''s too bad you did not follow the rules. A great pix gone to waste in a silly challenge over a virtual ribbon.', '2006-06-07 09:52:21.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494002, 340784, 17446, '<td valign="top">One of the most unique photos I''ve seen on this site in a while.  This is VERY nice!  Thank you for taking this picture.</td>', 'One of the most unique photos I''ve seen on this site in a while.  This is VERY nice!  Thank you for taking this picture.', '2006-06-07 09:55:41.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494021, 340309, 36006, '<td valign="top">I gave an average score to this piece. Personally, I think it is a ''good enough'' pix for DPC. But, at a showing somewhere it may be outstanding.<br/> <br/>The thing is, it just doesn''t have that wow factor. I know you wanted to show the model, and win a silly virtual ribbon, but I hope you took the time to experiment with your lighting. I hope you were shooting for yourself and found something that would fit the challenge, and not visa versa.<br/> <br/>This pix has so much potential. Top 50, not bad.</td>', 'I gave an average score to this piece. Personally, I think it is a ''good enough'' pix for DPC. But, at a showing somewhere it may be outstanding. The thing is, it just doesn''t have that wow factor. I know you wanted to show the model, and win a silly virtual ribbon, but I hope you took the time to experiment with your lighting. I hope you were shooting for yourself and found something that would fit the challenge, and not visa versa. This pix has so much potential. Top 50, not bad.', '2006-06-07 09:59:59.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494039, 340309, 37961, '<td valign="top">Great model...perfect skin and shape! Unusual pose ...works great.</td>', 'Great model...perfect skin and shape! Unusual pose ...works great.', '2006-06-07 10:04:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494040, 340092, 36006, '<td valign="top">65th is better than last.<br/> <br/>I think you were robbed. Your submission is definetly better than some of the submissions that got rated higher. That''s the subjectivness of this site.<br/> <br/>Nice entry, good job on this piece. You should be proud of it. <br/> <br/>Matte it, frame it, sell it.</td>', '65th is better than last. I think you were robbed. Your submission is definetly better than some of the submissions that got rated higher. That''s the subjectivness of this site. Nice entry, good job on this piece. You should be proud of it.  Matte it, frame it, sell it.', '2006-06-07 10:04:40.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494046, 340186, 51538, '<td valign="top">Congratulations!</td>', 'Congratulations!', '2006-06-07 10:05:52.000000', NULL, 0),
