(2494141, 340772, 9690, '<td valign="top">Yeah, they dinged ya!  Great submission.  It was probably the best of the whole challenge from an artistic point of view.  There''s too many photo-purists around here who would never get any emotion from a photograph.  All they care about are the texbook rules of photography.<br/> <br/>Keep pumping away!</td>', 'Yeah, they dinged ya!  Great submission.  It was probably the best of the whole challenge from an artistic point of view.  There''s too many photo-purists around here who would never get any emotion from a photograph.  All they care about are the texbook rules of photography. Keep pumping away!', '2006-06-07 10:26:14.000000', NULL, 0),
