(2494462, 340786, 2764, '<td valign="top">I think this image also could have suffered from "voter-monitor-calibration-syndrome"  Not all monitors are calibrated equally and dark images often suffer.  I just looked at this on a work monitor and it is so dark I can hardly make out the person.  The spot of light seems very bright.</td>', 'I think this image also could have suffered from "voter-monitor-calibration-syndrome"  Not all monitors are calibrated equally and dark images often suffer.  I just looked at this on a work monitor and it is so dark I can hardly make out the person.  The spot of light seems very bright.', '2006-06-07 11:44:23.000000', NULL, 0),
