(2494744, 338983, 42125, '<td valign="top">This picture is overexposed.<br/>You could use a baking paper and put it in front of the flash light to soften it. That way the feather would not be to bright.<br/>Also alternatively you could just use plain light to light up the feather and turn off the flash on the camera.<br/>Good luck with your next entries.</td>', 'This picture is overexposed.You could use a baking paper and put it in front of the flash light to soften it. That way the feather would not be to bright.Also alternatively you could just use plain light to light up the feather and turn off the flash on the camera.Good luck with your next entries.', '2006-06-07 13:27:19.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494831, 339381, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club.<br/> <br/>First Impression:<br/>Nice blue. Neat light source!<br/> <br/>Composition:<br/>Excellent positioning of your subjects. The pages really balance the negative space. Written text would have added some interest and action to the shot. Looks a bit static.<br/> <br/>Subject:<br/>Meets challenge<br/> <br/>Technical:<br/>DOF is shallow, but I dont know how much you could have influenced or out thought your camera settings.<br/>Nice contrast and compromise between blowing out the light and getting hand/paper detail.<br/>Soft focus works for this type of shot.<br/> <br/>Summary:<br/>Welcome to DPC. You have a good eye and you did very well with your second entry. Sooo close to a 6. Good luck with future entries!<br/></td>', 'Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club. First Impression:Nice blue. Neat light source! Composition:Excellent positioning of your subjects. The pages really balance the negative space. Written text would have added some interest and action to the shot. Looks a bit static. Subject:Meets challenge Technical:DOF is shallow, but I dont know how much you could have influenced or out thought your camera settings.Nice contrast and compromise between blowing out the light and getting hand/paper detail.Soft focus works for this type of shot. Summary:Welcome to DPC. You have a good eye and you did very well with your second entry. Sooo close to a 6. Good luck with future entries!', '2006-06-07 13:56:18.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494839, 339381, 32321, '<td valign="top">Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club. <br/> <br/>First Impression: <br/>Nice blue. Neat light source! <br/> <br/>Composition: <br/>Excellent positioning of your subjects. The pages really balance the negative space. Written text would have added some interest and action to the shot. Looks a bit static. <br/> <br/>Subject: <br/>Meets challenge <br/> <br/>Technical: <br/>DOF is shallow, but I dont know how much you could have influenced or out thought your camera settings. <br/>Nice contrast and compromise between blowing out the light and getting hand/paper detail. <br/>Soft focus works for this type of shot. <br/> <br/>Summary: <br/>Welcome to DPC. You have a good eye and you did very well with your second entry. Sooo close to a 6. Good luck with future entries! <br/></td>', 'Hi! Heres a comment from the Critique Club.  First Impression: Nice blue. Neat light source!  Composition: Excellent positioning of your subjects. The pages really balance the negative space. Written text would have added some interest and action to the shot. Looks a bit static.  Subject: Meets challenge  Technical: DOF is shallow, but I dont know how much you could have influenced or out thought your camera settings. Nice contrast and compromise between blowing out the light and getting hand/paper detail. Soft focus works for this type of shot.  Summary: Welcome to DPC. You have a good eye and you did very well with your second entry. Sooo close to a 6. Good luck with future entries! ', '2006-06-07 13:58:08.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494895, 340504, 37779, '<td valign="top">This is most excellent. The processing, idea, comp...everything seems to be spot on. Personally, I think this was really underrated. Should have gotten top ten. Nice work, sir.</td>', 'This is most excellent. The processing, idea, comp...everything seems to be spot on. Personally, I think this was really underrated. Should have gotten top ten. Nice work, sir.', '2006-06-07 14:20:15.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494967, 340748, 43309, '<td valign="top">Thanks so much for all the comments and the high votes! <br/>My comment on people being "appalled" by nudity was not meant to be a heated comment. I just get upset when people say that a great picture is no good because there''s nudity (I''ve seen it a lot even on this site). My remark was not directed at anyone specifically and it was written prior to submission. Picture was taken at about 10:45 and submitted just a few minutes before deadline, so I quickly wrote what was on my mind. The point I was trying to make is that the body is beautiful--somewhere along the way people have forgotten that...but that''s a rant for another day.<br/></td>', 'Thanks so much for all the comments and the high votes! My comment on people being "appalled" by nudity was not meant to be a heated comment. I just get upset when people say that a great picture is no good because there''s nudity (I''ve seen it a lot even on this site). My remark was not directed at anyone specifically and it was written prior to submission. Picture was taken at about 10:45 and submitted just a few minutes before deadline, so I quickly wrote what was on my mind. The point I was trying to make is that the body is beautiful--somewhere along the way people have forgotten that...but that''s a rant for another day.', '2006-06-07 14:39:51.000000', NULL, 0),
(2494996, 338815, 24503, '<td valign="top"><b>Hello from Álex, CTP MkII </b> <br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b>: Very clever shot.<br/><b>Composition</b>: OK, but maybe is too space up the subjects and subject is too centered, but not sure<br/><b>Subject</b>: very appropiate for the challenge. I think is original that the single light source is on the hands of the subject and the reflection is what lighten the scene.<br/><b>Technical</b>: very good IMO, very natural colors, good focus and lighting.<br/><b>Improvement</b>: maybe the composition, as told. I''m not sure, but you could have tried to crop leavin more black space on the left and so centered off the subject.<br/><b>Summary</b>: Intelligent idea and good realization, congrats on your third highest score<br/> <br/>Álex<br/></td>', 'Hello from Álex, CTP MkII   First Impression: Very clever shot.Composition: OK, but maybe is too space up the subjects and subject is too centered, but not sureSubject: very appropiate for the challenge. I think is original that the single light source is on the hands of the subject and the reflection is what lighten the scene.Technical: very good IMO, very natural colors, good focus and lighting.Improvement: maybe the composition, as told. I''m not sure, but you could have tried to crop leavin more black space on the left and so centered off the subject.Summary: Intelligent idea and good realization, congrats on your third highest score Álex', '2006-06-07 14:45:51.000000', NULL, 0),
