(2495455, 340239, 5885, '<td valign="top"><b><i>::: Greetings from Critique Club :::</i></b> <br/> <br/>Hi, as requested, here is an indepth critique of your submission.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression - the most important one:</b> <br/>Fun concept, but lighting comes across as a bit on the green side.<br/> <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>I appreciate the use of negative space, but I think it should be in front of the subject rather than behind the subject.<br/> <br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Clear in your face composition, subject is well defined by the lightsource.<br/> <br/><b>Technical (Color, focus, and light):</b> <br/>Color: As mentioned earlier it seems a bit on the green side.<br/>Focus looks sharp.<br/>Light: Very good, it illuminates just what you wanted illuminated.<br/> <br/><b>To grow its vote?:</b> <br/>A little stronger composition would have helped some. Not sure a "batman" theme would score real high in most challenges though.<br/> <br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>I like it. It''s fun and nicely done. Keep up the good work.<br/> <br/>Hope to see more from you soon,<br/>Leroy</td>', '::: Greetings from Critique Club :::  Hi, as requested, here is an indepth critique of your submission. First Impression - the most important one: Fun concept, but lighting comes across as a bit on the green side. Composition: I appreciate the use of negative space, but I think it should be in front of the subject rather than behind the subject. Subject: Clear in your face composition, subject is well defined by the lightsource. Technical (Color, focus, and light): Color: As mentioned earlier it seems a bit on the green side.Focus looks sharp.Light: Very good, it illuminates just what you wanted illuminated. To grow its vote?: A little stronger composition would have helped some. Not sure a "batman" theme would score real high in most challenges though. Summary: I like it. It''s fun and nicely done. Keep up the good work. Hope to see more from you soon,Leroy', '2006-06-07 16:43:23.000000', NULL, 0),
