(2497165, 340412, 49202, '<td valign="top">The challenge operated on the <b>"Use a single, artificial light source to dramatically light the subject of your choice."</b> rule, not on the <b>"Use a single light source on your photo. Period."</b> rule.<br/>Sheesh. I, for one, liked it. Bumped your score up a bit, to compensate for the low scores the others gave.<br/>Great job, Mr.Devilman.<br/> <br/>Edit: Splng<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-07 23:17:14.</i></td>', 'The challenge operated on the "Use a single, artificial light source to dramatically light the subject of your choice." rule, not on the "Use a single light source on your photo. Period." rule.Sheesh. I, for one, liked it. Bumped your score up a bit, to compensate for the low scores the others gave.Great job, Mr.Devilman. Edit: Splng', '2006-06-08 00:16:15.000000', '2006-06-08 00:17:14.000000', 0),
