(2497472, 339210, 59202, '<td valign="top">I also feel that this shot should have been cropped vertically. I also agree it is out of focus, I didnt noticed on the little screen of the camera. The drop of water falls straight into the face of the flashlight. I am pointing the flashlight directly to the faucet.<br/>I did not spent any time editing, just resized for web. Next time I will spend more time on it. Thanks for the comments. I hope I keep learning from you guys.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-08 01:10:57.</i></td>', 'I also feel that this shot should have been cropped vertically. I also agree it is out of focus, I didnt noticed on the little screen of the camera. The drop of water falls straight into the face of the flashlight. I am pointing the flashlight directly to the faucet.I did not spent any time editing, just resized for web. Next time I will spend more time on it. Thanks for the comments. I hope I keep learning from you guys.', '2006-06-08 02:06:50.000000', '2006-06-08 02:10:57.000000', 0),
