(2513628, 340660, 41372, '<td valign="top">I am a spider lover.  Really!  I love this photo and have it as my desktop.  My plates on my car read "MS SPIDR".  This particular one is beautiful with all its different colors.  And your Single Light Source just took my breath away.  I keep admiring its colored "toes" if you will.  Well, I could go on forever.  Thanks for taking a chance for this one.  : )<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-13 17:50:09.</i></td>', 'I am a spider lover.  Really!  I love this photo and have it as my desktop.  My plates on my car read "MS SPIDR".  This particular one is beautiful with all its different colors.  And your Single Light Source just took my breath away.  I keep admiring its colored "toes" if you will.  Well, I could go on forever.  Thanks for taking a chance for this one.  : )', '2006-06-13 18:49:38.000000', '2006-06-13 18:50:09.000000', 0),
(2513973, 340660, 41794, '<td valign="top">Man, if that would have been me I wouldn''t be alive to tell about it. LOL. Seriously, I am so terrified of spiders that I think if something this size jumped anywhere on my, let alone my face, I would die of fright!<br/>That being said - this is a great photo. Good color with the single light source and the detail is great.</td>', 'Man, if that would have been me I wouldn''t be alive to tell about it. LOL. Seriously, I am so terrified of spiders that I think if something this size jumped anywhere on my, let alone my face, I would die of fright!That being said - this is a great photo. Good color with the single light source and the detail is great.', '2006-06-13 21:40:09.000000', NULL, 0),
(2517587, 338766, 51538, '<td valign="top">Another nice compsition.  Obviously you appreciate the dark stuff to have rendered it so cleanly and respectfully!  Nice work and I look forward to seeing more.</td>', 'Another nice compsition.  Obviously you appreciate the dark stuff to have rendered it so cleanly and respectfully!  Nice work and I look forward to seeing more.', '2006-06-14 18:22:52.000000', NULL, 0),
(2517725, 340601, 37623, '<td valign="top">thanks to all who voted, and thanks for the comments.  this was a photo of opportunity...i had been searching for an idea, and during my morning drive and meditation, God gave me His answer--I couldn''t not submit it.  so it wasn''t a staged photo, it was a quick snap at a red light, and hope for the best.  my thoughts about this submission are that it is the ultimate example of THE SINGLE LIGHT SOURCE, and any other light is artificial.  Thanks again to all, and God Bless!  (final note:  praying to God helps in any situation...it''s His designed "hot line"... <br/> <br/>the old geezer</td>', 'thanks to all who voted, and thanks for the comments.  this was a photo of opportunity...i had been searching for an idea, and during my morning drive and meditation, God gave me His answer--I couldn''t not submit it.  so it wasn''t a staged photo, it was a quick snap at a red light, and hope for the best.  my thoughts about this submission are that it is the ultimate example of THE SINGLE LIGHT SOURCE, and any other light is artificial.  Thanks again to all, and God Bless!  (final note:  praying to God helps in any situation...it''s His designed "hot line"...  the old geezer', '2006-06-14 18:54:04.000000', NULL, 0),
(2518663, 340689, 38496, '<td valign="top">hi from ctp2:<br/> <br/>Congrats on a pb!  This is a very moody picture.  The viewer is drawn straight into the eyes, which are very intense, and a great contrast with the dark of the rest of the photo.  I like the way your hair is falling over your eyes, yet the eyes still stand out.  The off center crop works really well too.  Well done!</td>', 'hi from ctp2: Congrats on a pb!  This is a very moody picture.  The viewer is drawn straight into the eyes, which are very intense, and a great contrast with the dark of the rest of the photo.  I like the way your hair is falling over your eyes, yet the eyes still stand out.  The off center crop works really well too.  Well done!', '2006-06-15 00:13:44.000000', NULL, 0),
(2519799, 340689, 42125, '<td valign="top"><b>CTCP2 Gunnsi<br/>First impression:</b> <br/>Great portrait. Dark but still very good.<br/><b>What can you do better?</b> <br/>A different crop, take 1 sm from the top. Clone away the zipper in the right it only distracts. Get a better selfesteem :-) You look good.<br/>Congratulations on your highest score.</td>', 'CTCP2 GunnsiFirst impression: Great portrait. Dark but still very good.What can you do better? A different crop, take 1 sm from the top. Clone away the zipper in the right it only distracts. Get a better selfesteem :-) You look good.Congratulations on your highest score.', '2006-06-15 10:48:48.000000', NULL, 0),
(2519859, 340786, 42125, '<td valign="top"><b>CTP2 Gunnsi<br/>First impression:</b> <br/>To bright light and to dark head.<br/><b>What can you do better?</b> <br/>decrease the light in the front and increase the light on the head from the back making a better shilouette.</td>', 'CTP2 GunnsiFirst impression: To bright light and to dark head.What can you do better? decrease the light in the front and increase the light on the head from the back making a better shilouette.', '2006-06-15 11:19:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2521652, 340504, 7628, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by Melethia:</b></div><hr/><i> The fist and arm do indeed look very angry.  I like the post processing - the arm is soft yet the nail is very sharp.  You created an excellent mood with this shot! </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Absolutely - the processing is masterful!  Can''t wait to see what you do next!<br/></td>', 'Originally posted by Melethia: The fist and arm do indeed look very angry.  I like the post processing - the arm is soft yet the nail is very sharp.  You created an excellent mood with this shot!   Absolutely - the processing is masterful!  Can''t wait to see what you do next!', '2006-06-16 00:11:38.000000', NULL, 0),
(2521983, 339121, 16004, '<td valign="top">i think that by taking a used, old, repeated idea but doing something creative and different to it, itself becomes creative and new.  anyone who automatically gave this a sub-par vote or dimissed it on this basis is probably a bit of a moron - the fact that you even cite someone else in the title makes it clear that it''s an homage, and it should ideally be considered as that.  to me it''s visually striking, simple, clean, and expertly taken.  the whites are very lovely.  the only slight misgiving i would have with it is that it doesn''t really scream to me, this was taken with a single source of light.  but then that''s lust me being picky and not very technically adept.  i like it as a piece of art, and would have scored it an 8.</td>', 'i think that by taking a used, old, repeated idea but doing something creative and different to it, itself becomes creative and new.  anyone who automatically gave this a sub-par vote or dimissed it on this basis is probably a bit of a moron - the fact that you even cite someone else in the title makes it clear that it''s an homage, and it should ideally be considered as that.  to me it''s visually striking, simple, clean, and expertly taken.  the whites are very lovely.  the only slight misgiving i would have with it is that it doesn''t really scream to me, this was taken with a single source of light.  but then that''s lust me being picky and not very technically adept.  i like it as a piece of art, and would have scored it an 8.', '2006-06-16 06:04:23.000000', NULL, 0),
(2522727, 340689, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club. Sorry, I was off the hook for a while.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b> <br/>Very Nice strong image. <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Good Composition.<br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Very nice.<br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>Very nice. I really like the sharpness, it makes the image even stonger. <br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>More details on the hair and BG, but I don''t think it was possible because it was Single Light Source challenge.<br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Very nice strong image. Looks more like the shot from one of my favorite photographer on DPC -   <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=14386" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">"Librodo"</a> <br/> <br/>Congratulations on your Personal Best. Keep shooting.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2006-06-16 13:59:52.</i></td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club. Sorry, I was off the hook for a while. First Impression Very Nice strong image. Composition: Good Composition.Subject: Very nice.Technical (Colour and light): Very nice. I really like the sharpness, it makes the image even stonger. Improvement: More details on the hair and BG, but I don''t think it was possible because it was Single Light Source challenge.Summary: Very nice strong image. Looks more like the shot from one of my favorite photographer on DPC -   "Librodo"  Congratulations on your Personal Best. Keep shooting.', '2006-06-16 14:58:59.000000', '2006-06-16 14:59:52.000000', 0),
