(2548514, 340784, 48954, '<td valign="top">Peter, you were right. this is a freakin'' kick ass shot. When I saw it on your blackberry i wasn''t sure if i had seen it right or not. But now that i see it on my own computer....damnnnnnn. sweet ass shiznat!</td>', 'Peter, you were right. this is a freakin'' kick ass shot. When I saw it on your blackberry i wasn''t sure if i had seen it right or not. But now that i see it on my own computer....damnnnnnn. sweet ass shiznat!', '2006-06-24 11:45:33.000000', NULL, 0),
(2549006, 338815, 30454, '<td valign="top">Greetings from your own critique club.<br/> <br/><b>First Impression</b> <br/>Very Nice shot. <br/><b>Composition:</b> <br/>Composition is alright. May be a tighter crop would have worked better.<br/><b>Subject:</b> <br/>Meets the challenge.<br/><b>Technical (Colour and light):</b> <br/>The color and lighting is wonderful. <br/><b>Improvement:</b> <br/>Little bit tighter crop<br/><b>Summary:</b> <br/>Nice over all picture, brings back the memories of chidhood.<br/> <br/>Congratualtions on nice capture, cheers!!</td>', 'Greetings from your own critique club. First Impression Very Nice shot. Composition: Composition is alright. May be a tighter crop would have worked better.Subject: Meets the challenge.Technical (Colour and light): The color and lighting is wonderful. Improvement: Little bit tighter cropSummary: Nice over all picture, brings back the memories of chidhood. Congratualtions on nice capture, cheers!!', '2006-06-24 16:35:50.000000', NULL, 0),
(2550968, 339945, 31794, '<td valign="top">[[trading post]]<br/> <br/>first, the image is too dark, it looks like the bottle and glass is floating in the darkness.<br/> <br/>the bottle needs some spotlight to show the edges of the bottle.<br/>the image looks oversharpened, what I think is bubbles in the glass looks like floating dirt.<br/> <br/>and I think the image is overprocessed, a big part of the glass is completely white, even if both the glass and wine is transparent.<br/> <br/>and I think the composition is a bit off.. the bottleneck is lower than the base of the bottle, that makes the weight in the image very odd, like there is no gravity.<br/> <br/>but it''s still a good try, play more with the wine and glass and eventually you''ll get a good picture.</td>', '[[trading post]] first, the image is too dark, it looks like the bottle and glass is floating in the darkness. the bottle needs some spotlight to show the edges of the bottle.the image looks oversharpened, what I think is bubbles in the glass looks like floating dirt. and I think the image is overprocessed, a big part of the glass is completely white, even if both the glass and wine is transparent. and I think the composition is a bit off.. the bottleneck is lower than the base of the bottle, that makes the weight in the image very odd, like there is no gravity. but it''s still a good try, play more with the wine and glass and eventually you''ll get a good picture.', '2006-06-25 07:47:31.000000', NULL, 0),
(2551880, 340110, 46294, '<td valign="top">Wow I love this one, and am I the only one who loves the white background? With no background it will; be just one of the many leafstructures pics, the white background adds a bit extra! Faved it!</td>', 'Wow I love this one, and am I the only one who loves the white background? With no background it will; be just one of the many leafstructures pics, the white background adds a bit extra! Faved it!', '2006-06-25 15:58:28.000000', NULL, 0),
