(2587566, 339859, 48228, '<td valign="top">For someone so young, you have a great sense of feeling, re this shot of these roses. Keep up the good work, and before you know it, I will be adding one of your images to my favorites. I have added you to my list of favorite photographers, as I want to watch you grow.</td>', 'For someone so young, you have a great sense of feeling, re this shot of these roses. Keep up the good work, and before you know it, I will be adding one of your images to my favorites. I have added you to my list of favorite photographers, as I want to watch you grow.', '2006-07-05 11:40:20.000000', NULL, 0),
(2594087, 340635, 38732, '<td valign="top">Condensation trapped behind plastic wrap...how much more abstract can you get?  Either you have a great eye or great luck, but your abstracts are captivating.  I love it!  A fav :)</td>', 'Condensation trapped behind plastic wrap...how much more abstract can you get?  Either you have a great eye or great luck, but your abstracts are captivating.  I love it!  A fav :)', '2006-07-06 16:58:35.000000', NULL, 0),
