(2625452, 338618, 20530, '<td valign="top">A pro shooting a model would be happy with such results. Even more impressive considering the fact that it''s a SP! The pose is perfect; alluring and graceful and perfectly accentuating your curves. Lighting and tones are great too. Kudos to you for not ruining it with noise reduction software.</td>', 'A pro shooting a model would be happy with such results. Even more impressive considering the fact that it''s a SP! The pose is perfect; alluring and graceful and perfectly accentuating your curves. Lighting and tones are great too. Kudos to you for not ruining it with noise reduction software.', '2006-07-15 20:46:46.000000', NULL, 0),
